+         `Ignore` (2), `Unimplemented` (3), `Debug` (4), `ServiceRequest` (5), `ServiceAccept`
+         (6), `ExtInfo` (7), `KexInit` (20), `NewKeys` (21), `KexEcdhInit` (30), `KexEcdhReply`

